  "strings": [
    "Minas Tirith is breached.\u0000",
    "The gates are shattered and the lower walls of the city are overrun.\u0000",
    "The men of Gondor attempt a valiant defense.\u0000",
    "But Sauron's hordes have taken full measure of this frail city.\u0000",
    "And they will not be denied.\u0000",
